sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor p0 as User
  participant p1 as Client
  participant p2 as Server
  participant p3 as Database
  p0->>p1: Click log in
  p1->>+p2: POST /login
  p2-->>p3: Find user
  p3-->>p2: Row
  p2->>p2: Check password
  p2-->>-p1: Session token
  p1-)p2: Track login
  p1-xp0: Show dashboard
